@startuml
title Current budget graph: one run for one user and date
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
start
:Create agent_runs row: running;
:load_state -> initialize_budget;
note right
First fit: up to 3 prior calendar months.
Exclude income, transfers, card payments.
Net refunds within each category.
Fixed: lower median of paying months.
Flexible: median x 1.05; skip zero median.
Persist fit evidence with budget lines.
end note
if (No budget / date before start?) then (yes)
  :Finish no_budget;
  stop
elseif (Date past period end?) then (yes)
  :Finish period_ended;
  note right: Opening next month needs TPC-22.
  stop
endif
:sync (if sync_fn supplied);
note right
Initialization runs BEFORE this sync.
Sync failures keep checking stored data.
end note
:categorize: count uncategorized only;
:update_totals: net category spending;
:detect_overspend;
note right
All lines: spent > limit.
Flexible only: from day 5,
pace >= 1.10 also flags.
Unbudgeted categories: reported, not flagged.
end note
if (Any flags?) then (no)
  :persist_state -> ok;
  stop
endif
:Code builds facts and proposed limits;
:Gateway minimizes and audits each category;
:diagnose: LLM classifies cause;
:decide_action: LLM picks action;
note right
Invalid structured output retries once,
then falls back to an ordinary alert.
Transport failure marks the run error.
Memory asks model to avoid repeats.
Only recurring causes may adjust a limit.
end note
:log_advice: alerts + linked advice rows;
if (Adjust proposal AND checkpointer?) then (yes)
  :await_approval -> interrupt;
  :awaiting_user until every proposal decided;
endif
:persist_state -> ok + summary;
stop
@enduml
